      "en": "As some were talking about the temple and how it was decorated with beautiful stones and gifts, he said,",
      "ko": "어떤 사람들이 성전을 가리켜 그 미석과 헌물로 꾸민 것을 말하매 예수께서 가라사대",
      "source_text_hash": "0aedbab6a73f5addaf3895f40cc36f47060405cfc8daae41aa82c053a29d6f95",
      "translation_text_hash": "18fdeea1e203d442c53e074578ea93254187dfe80eaabc4bc3da7c6a2a3c21fe",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
