      "en": "“As for these things which you see, the days will come in which there will not be left here one stone on another that will not be thrown down.”",
      "ko": "너희 보는 이것들이 날이 이르면 돌 하나도 돌 위에 남지 않고 다 무너뜨리우리라",
      "source_text_hash": "ab6b751a89822aee984a37d6236ce3abc167c297ef9b490eb1c29e5e05dabf5f",
      "translation_text_hash": "a679852d5155cfa76e4ff548962a7635e5805ab4c18d783917958f37077f746d",
